## Next actions by project or area

The dropdown on every list sets a task's status. An agent finishes the change: archives a done task and promotes the next step, or asks who a waiting-for task waits on.

```dataviewjs
await dv.view("Agents/views/task-status", {status: "next-action", group: "project", columns: "contexts,due"})
```

